gn. It may appear with printed document pages in plain folders and a laptop showing the package's Excel tools (a cluster performance dashboard with red-yellow-green status cells and a 12-month work calendar). Do not redesign, simplify, recolor, or rebrand the box. SET & PROPS: Puskesmas front terrace at midday: tiled terrace, a row of parked staff motorbikes, a notice board with pinned papers (no readable text), potted plants, bright daylight; then the kapus office with a table, a laptop and plain folders. Staff only as blurred shapes far away. TIMELINE — 10 seconds: 0–2s Hook · close-up: a row of parked staff motorbikes; cut to medium shot as she turns to the camera on the terrace. VO (ID, verbatim): "Saya kapus pindahan, baru masuk." Delivery (EN): calm, candid 2–4s Problem · medium shot, she glances back at the building entrance. VO (ID, verbatim): "Tiap usul, jawabnya dulu tidak begitu." Delivery (EN): honest, slightly amused 4–6s Problem · medium close-up, she folds her arms gently. VO (ID, verbatim): "Saya tidak mau debat pakai perasaan." Delivery (EN): firm 6–8s Problem · medium shot, she nods toward the notice board. VO (ID, verbatim): "Kinerja klaster harus kelihatan jelas." Delivery (EN): determined 8–10s Beat · medium shot, she walks inside toward her office. VO: none. AUDIO: Midday puskesmas terrace ambience, motorbike starting far away, birds. Only the talent speaks. Natural Indonesian, conversational, clear pronunciation, no background music. Lighting/mood: realistic natural light matching the set, clean soft contrast, believable Indonesian setting, not glossy, not studio. Camera: follow the camera style above consistently; stable and restrained, no whip pans, no drone, no 360 orbit. Keep product readable whenever it is on screen. Performance: natural facial expression, believable professional UGC, natural eye contact, restrained gestures, no exaggerated acting. Lips clearly synced to each word. Hands: simple, natural, relaxed movements. CLEAN OUTPUT: 